{"name":"Affair","hex":"#745085","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"affair","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Something which is done or is to be done; business of any kind, commercial, professional, or public.","Any proceeding or action which it is wished to refer to or characterize vaguely."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/affair"}],"entries":[{"title":"Affair","blocks":[{"text":"An affair is a relationship typically between two people, one or both of whom are either married or in a long-term monogamous or emotionally-exclusive relationship with another person. The affair can be solely sexual, solely physical, solely emotional, or a combination of these."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Affair"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Jean-Honor%C3%A9_Fragonard_-_The_Stolen_Kiss.jpg/500px-Jean-Honor%C3%A9_Fragonard_-_The_Stolen_Kiss.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Jean-Honor%C3%A9_Fragonard_-_The_Stolen_Kiss.jpg/1280px-Jean-Honor%C3%A9_Fragonard_-_The_Stolen_Kiss.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Jean-Honor%C3%A9_Fragonard_-_The_Stolen_Kiss.jpg/500px-Jean-Honor%C3%A9_Fragonard_-_The_Stolen_Kiss.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Stolen Kiss by Jean-Honoré Fragonard","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJean-Honor%C3%A9_Fragonard_-_The_Stolen_Kiss.jpg"}],"sounds":{"affair":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ce/En-us-affair.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ce/En-us-affair.ogg/En-us-affair.ogg.mp3"}]}}}